WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:21.329
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:21.599 --> 01:22.120
Shen Leshui.

3
01:22.480 --> 01:23.599
When are you giving me that money?

4
01:27.000 --> 01:27.480
Soon.

5
01:27.959 --> 01:29.159
I'm going back home tomorrow to sell the house.

6
01:29.439 --> 01:30.400
Are you coming back to Beijing then?

7
01:30.560 --> 01:31.280
No, I'm not.

8
01:44.480 --> 01:45.719
Shen Leshui,

9
01:47.680 --> 01:48.879
wishing you a

10
01:49.680 --> 01:51.079
happy birthday.

11
03:53.159 --> 03:53.639
Right.

12
03:54.400 --> 03:55.240
As long as it's cash.

13
03:57.400 --> 03:58.280
Get your candied haws!

14
03:59.719 --> 04:00.599
I can go a bit lower.

15
04:00.680 --> 04:01.280
Candied haws!

16
04:01.280 --> 04:02.039
I need the cash urgently.

17
04:02.879 --> 04:03.719
Be careful.

18
04:05.360 --> 04:05.759
Okay.

19
04:06.240 --> 04:07.159
Freshly popped popcorn!

20
04:07.520 --> 04:08.919
Isn't that Shen Leshui?

21
04:09.000 --> 04:10.479
Haven't seen her in so many years.

22
04:11.000 --> 04:11.319
Good grief.

23
04:11.319 --> 04:13.039
Wasn't she doing quite well in Beijing?

24
04:13.280 --> 04:14.240
Why is she back?

25
04:14.240 --> 04:15.319
Look at her, all dressed up.

26
04:24.639 --> 04:25.360
Under its influence,

27
04:25.360 --> 04:25.920
over the next three days,

28
04:25.920 --> 04:27.120
most parts of northern China

29
04:27.120 --> 04:28.680
will experience strong winds and dropping temperatures.

30
04:29.040 --> 04:29.839
Meanwhile, under the combined influence of cold air

31
04:29.839 --> 04:31.199
and warm, moist air currents,

32
04:31.360 --> 04:32.120
over the next three days,

33
04:32.120 --> 04:34.319
the south will still see significant precipitation.

34
04:34.680 --> 04:35.759
Please clean up

35
04:35.920 --> 04:37.240
Unit 1, Building 18,

36
04:37.800 --> 04:39.040
the garbage outside Room 302,

37
04:40.000 --> 04:41.800
and remind them not to pile it up.

38
05:25.120 --> 05:26.240
It's already this low,

39
05:26.360 --> 05:27.480
and he's still haggling?

40
05:28.000 --> 05:29.439
I really need the money,

41
05:30.079 --> 05:31.800
or I wouldn't have come all the way back.

42
05:32.920 --> 05:33.680
Just hold out for now.

43
05:34.319 --> 05:35.360
If you really can't hold out, we'll talk.

44
05:44.160 --> 05:45.319
Star reporter, star director!

45
05:45.600 --> 05:46.079
Holy smokes!

46
05:46.079 --> 05:47.000
What a coincidence, Ma Guowen!

47
05:47.319 --> 05:48.199
Director Ma.

48
05:49.040 --> 05:50.079
Long time no see!

49
05:50.639 --> 05:52.279
You haven't changed a bit!

50
05:52.519 --> 05:53.879
Look at me, I've gotten so old.

51
05:54.920 --> 05:55.600
Director Ma.

52
05:56.160 --> 05:56.959
Long time no see.

53
05:57.240 --> 05:58.959
I was just saying I want to make a promo video,

54
05:58.959 --> 06:00.240
and boom, I run right into you!

55
06:00.279 --> 06:01.480
What a coincidence!

56
06:01.680 --> 06:02.639
A busy person like you,

57
06:02.839 --> 06:04.439
what brings you back to Lacheng?

58
06:04.600 --> 06:05.759
Just visiting my mom,

59
06:06.319 --> 06:07.680
and sorting out the house.

60
06:09.759 --> 06:11.000
What happened to your hand?

61
06:11.199 --> 06:12.079
Cut it on some glass.

62
06:12.480 --> 06:13.040
Getting some medicine.

63
06:13.439 --> 06:13.839
It's nothing.

64
06:14.680 --> 06:15.439
Hop in, then.

65
06:15.560 --> 06:16.639
I'll give you a lift to get medicine.

66
06:16.639 --> 06:17.199
No, really, don't bother.

67
06:17.199 --> 06:18.040
I'd rather walk.

68
06:19.000 --> 06:19.800
Don't go!

69
06:20.319 --> 06:21.959
Didn't I say I had serious business?

70
06:22.279 --> 06:24.120
This time, I want to invest good money

71
06:24.160 --> 06:24.959
and make a real blockbuster.

72
06:28.399 --> 06:30.160
How's business at the factory?

73
06:30.439 --> 06:32.439
A blockbuster costs a lot of money.

74
06:33.439 --> 06:34.879
Precisely because business isn't good,

75
06:34.879 --> 06:36.480
we need to promote it with a video!

76
06:36.720 --> 06:38.199
In the past, good wine

77
06:38.560 --> 06:39.319
needed no bush.

78
06:39.480 --> 06:41.360
Now, even good wine gets overlooked!

79
06:41.360 --> 06:42.399
So we have to advertise!

80
06:42.560 --> 06:43.519
The worse it gets, the more we need promo.

81
06:44.439 --> 06:44.879
How about this?

82
06:44.959 --> 06:45.680
Let's talk on the way.

83
06:45.720 --> 06:46.319
I'll tell you all about it.

84
06:46.560 --> 06:46.959
Come on, get in.

85
06:46.959 --> 06:47.560
Hop in, hop in.

86
06:49.199 --> 06:49.680
Thank you.

87
06:49.800 --> 06:51.199
Man, what a crazy coincidence!

88
06:51.199 --> 06:51.680
See,

89
06:54.879 --> 06:55.600
Xiao Rui,

90
06:56.240 --> 06:57.240
Director Shen here...

91
06:57.240 --> 06:59.079
...is a big-shot director from Beijing!

92
06:59.160 --> 07:00.439
She directed our The Malt Kingdom!

93
07:00.439 --> 07:01.560
She even won big awards!

94
07:02.000 --> 07:04.160
When do you plan to shoot this blockbuster?

95
07:04.240 --> 07:05.160
I'm back this time,

96
07:05.160 --> 07:06.120
but can only stay a few days.

97
07:06.680 --> 07:07.480
You're in a hurry?

98
07:07.759 --> 07:09.040
I'm actually in more of a rush than you!

99
07:09.240 --> 07:10.439
We'll get right on it.

100
07:10.519 --> 07:11.439
How much

101
07:12.399 --> 07:13.279
are you planning to spend

102
07:13.399 --> 07:14.079
on this film?

103
07:15.240 --> 07:16.879
Well, you're the expert.

104
07:16.920 --> 07:17.920
I should be asking you!

105
07:17.920 --> 07:18.480
Give me...

106
07:18.720 --> 07:19.800
...give us a ballpark figure.

107
07:19.959 --> 07:20.720
Give me an honest quote,

108
07:21.040 --> 07:21.439
all right?

109
07:22.639 --> 07:23.199
300,000.

110
07:23.199 --> 07:24.120
Does that work for you?

111
07:25.120 --> 07:26.240
The factory is about to be sold.

112
07:26.439 --> 07:27.680
Where would we get that kind of money?

113
07:27.879 --> 07:28.360
Sell?

114
07:28.959 --> 07:29.879
Selling the factory again?

115
07:30.480 --> 07:31.560
Look at me now.

116
07:32.040 --> 07:33.399
My hair has gone completely gray.

117
07:33.399 --> 07:35.240
My old body is falling apart.

118
07:35.600 --> 07:36.959
I just can't keep going.

119
07:37.560 --> 07:38.279
Selling the factory...

120
07:38.959 --> 07:39.720
making a film...

121
07:40.399 --> 07:41.560
Over ten years...

122
07:42.560 --> 07:43.160
Fine, all right.

123
07:43.560 --> 07:44.639
Never thought... Let's do 300,000.

124
07:44.639 --> 07:45.560
...I'd end up back here.

125
07:45.560 --> 07:46.879
Make it a good one for me, Director Shen.

126
07:48.560 --> 07:49.279
What's the matter?

127
07:50.000 --> 07:51.160
Don't be upset.

128
07:51.560 --> 07:52.199
If you...

129
07:52.639 --> 07:53.040
...well...

130
07:53.439 --> 07:54.160
...if you're worried,

131
07:54.480 --> 07:56.279
take this 30,000 deposit first.

132
08:01.879 --> 08:02.480
Good grief.

133
08:02.879 --> 08:03.360
You... you...

134
08:03.519 --> 08:04.120
Are you sure...

135
08:04.120 --> 08:05.800
...you really don't want a ride home?

136
08:05.879 --> 08:06.519
No need, really.

137
08:06.519 --> 08:07.079
This is fine.

138
08:07.560 --> 08:08.800
Then we have a deal!

139
08:08.800 --> 08:09.439
First thing tomorrow morning,

140
08:09.439 --> 08:10.319
I'll wait for you at the factory.

141
08:10.399 --> 08:11.040
See you there!

142
08:24.600 --> 08:25.480
Hey, Xiao Liu.

143
08:27.720 --> 08:28.680
Another few days?

144
08:29.839 --> 08:30.879
I really need the money.

145
08:31.120 --> 08:32.159
Could you push him again?

146
08:32.879 --> 08:33.360
All right.

147
08:33.639 --> 08:34.120
Thanks.

148
08:42.919 --> 08:43.480
Haipeng!

149
08:44.080 --> 08:44.720
It's me.

150
08:46.480 --> 08:47.159
You made it.

151
08:49.039 --> 08:50.240
Look at you!

152
08:51.639 --> 08:52.759
Just got back to Lacheng,

153
08:52.759 --> 08:54.279
and you already landed such a sweet gig.

154
08:56.440 --> 08:57.919
That's our Shen Leshui for you.

155
08:59.240 --> 08:59.840
Let's sit down and talk.

156
09:01.879 --> 09:04.120
Looks like Ma Guowen's eager to sell the plant.

157
09:05.159 --> 09:06.039
Just watch your back.

158
09:06.720 --> 09:07.720
I'm worried he might stiff you.

159
09:09.559 --> 09:10.799
You know him better than I do.

160
09:11.039 --> 09:12.480
Everyone knows what kind of guy he is.

161
09:12.759 --> 09:13.159
No, no.

162
09:13.559 --> 09:14.120
Not here.

163
09:15.039 --> 09:16.159
I just remodeled the shop.

164
09:16.159 --> 09:17.080
Take a look around.

165
09:18.639 --> 09:19.200
Listen to me,

166
09:19.399 --> 09:20.159
the most important thing is

167
09:20.399 --> 09:22.360
to make this quick buck as fast as possible.

168
09:22.559 --> 09:23.039
That's true.

169
09:24.919 --> 09:25.919
If I didn't need the money so badly,

170
09:26.120 --> 09:27.039
I wouldn't have taken this job.

171
09:27.039 --> 09:29.000
I've got the crew and gear all ready for you.

172
09:29.399 --> 09:30.919
But when you start shooting tomorrow,

173
09:30.919 --> 09:31.799
I won't be able to join you.

174
09:32.559 --> 09:34.399
Lili has a prenatal checkup first thing tomorrow.

175
09:36.639 --> 09:37.679
You're gonna be a dad?

176
09:38.720 --> 09:39.399
Congratulations!

177
09:41.159 --> 09:42.360
Your shop looks great too.

178
09:43.559 --> 09:44.759
Business seems to be booming.

179
09:45.240 --> 09:45.799
Pretty good.

180
09:46.000 --> 09:47.120
Just hustling along.

181
09:47.320 --> 09:48.080
Depends on who you compare it to.

182
09:48.399 --> 09:49.840
Compared to you, I've got a long way to go.

183
09:50.519 --> 09:51.679
Come on, let's sit and chat over here.

184
09:52.559 --> 09:53.039
Where's the tea?

185
09:55.759 --> 09:56.279
How about you?

186
09:57.320 --> 09:58.080
Seeing anyone yet?

187
09:59.600 --> 10:00.200
Here's your tea, Boss.

188
10:01.000 --> 10:01.799
I've got plenty of suitors.

189
10:02.000 --> 10:02.720
No need for you to worry.

190
10:03.759 --> 10:04.440
Do you have a drone?

191
10:04.919 --> 10:05.399
Yeah, I do.

192
10:06.519 --> 10:07.080
Besides that,

193
10:07.399 --> 10:08.639
two professional cameras,

194
10:08.759 --> 10:09.559
one sound recorder.

195
10:09.759 --> 10:10.759
I'll find the line producer.

196
10:14.840 --> 10:16.600
I'll notify the drone crew right now.

197
10:16.919 --> 10:17.360
By the way,

198
10:17.879 --> 10:18.840
you don't have to pay them.

199
10:21.240 --> 10:22.559
I'll cover their wages.

200
10:23.039 --> 10:24.000
Then I'll pay you.

201
10:26.360 --> 10:27.919
Why are you acting like a stranger?

202
10:29.120 --> 10:30.159
Once I sell my house,

203
10:30.679 --> 10:32.279
the money for my mom's surgery,

204
10:32.480 --> 10:33.679
plus what I borrowed from you,

205
10:33.759 --> 10:34.480
I'll pay it all back.

206
10:36.960 --> 10:37.720
What are you talking about?

207
10:38.039 --> 10:39.320
Are you trying to draw a line between us?

208
10:41.840 --> 10:43.480
Did I do something wrong?

209
10:44.600 --> 10:45.919
Even real brothers keep clear accounts.

210
10:47.480 --> 10:48.600
If we're brothers...

211
10:50.639 --> 10:51.320
Alright.

212
10:52.039 --> 10:52.919
Brothers it is.

213
10:55.200 --> 10:55.600
Xing!

214
10:55.639 --> 10:56.279
Put the monitor here.

215
10:56.440 --> 10:57.840
All Unit One crew, switch to Channel One.

216
10:57.879 --> 10:58.679
Unit Two crew, switch to Channel Two.

217
10:58.679 --> 10:59.480
Copy that, everyone?

218
11:00.000 --> 11:00.480
Apple box!

219
11:00.600 --> 11:01.000
Here.

220
11:04.399 --> 11:04.720
Come closer.

221
11:04.720 --> 11:05.159
Director Shen, come closer.

222
11:05.799 --> 11:06.600
The monitor is set up.

223
11:08.679 --> 11:09.639
Five minutes until it pulls into the station.

224
11:09.919 --> 11:10.919
Unit One and Unit Two, follow me.

225
11:11.159 --> 11:11.639
Got it!

226
11:12.000 --> 11:12.679
Stay safe!

227
11:12.799 --> 11:13.399
Let's go. On it!

228
11:15.519 --> 11:15.960
Director!

229
11:16.039 --> 11:16.679
Ready? The drone is in position.

230
11:23.639 --> 11:24.840
Old Zhang, how's it looking on your end?

231
11:25.799 --> 11:26.759
All set, Director!

232
11:28.600 --> 11:29.240
Stand by.

233
11:30.279 --> 11:30.840
Action!

234
11:39.120 --> 11:39.879
Hold it.

235
11:40.519 --> 11:41.200
The train's coming!

236
11:42.480 --> 11:43.759
That's good. Head over to the tracks.

237
11:44.320 --> 11:44.679
Okay.

238
11:48.639 --> 11:49.720
Looks like there's someone on the tracks!

239
11:50.279 --> 11:50.639
Where?

240
11:57.919 --> 11:58.559
Look out! Watch out!

241
11:58.639 --> 11:59.440
There's someone on the tracks!

242
11:59.720 --> 12:00.440
Go check it out, quick!

243
12:00.639 --> 12:01.360
Go check!

244
12:01.720 --> 12:02.080
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

245
12:12.120 --> 12:12.960
Clear the way ahead!

246
12:13.039 --> 12:13.840
Clear the way ahead!

247
12:13.879 --> 12:14.519
Hurry!

248
12:17.000 --> 12:18.559
Move! Out of the way!

249
12:18.960 --> 12:19.559
Director, look!

250
12:21.360 --> 12:22.200
Don't go over there!

251
12:22.639 --> 12:23.600
Stop the train!

252
12:24.240 --> 12:25.159
Stay back!

253
12:25.480 --> 12:25.919
Stop the train!

254
12:25.919 --> 12:26.799
Don't go over there!

255
12:27.480 --> 12:28.159
Stop the train!

256
12:28.200 --> 12:29.080
Make the train stop!

257
12:29.080 --> 12:30.000
Stop!

258
12:30.559 --> 12:31.600
Make it stop!

259
12:31.600 --> 12:32.679
Stop the train! Stop!

260
12:34.559 --> 12:35.080
Don't move!

261
12:44.519 --> 12:45.399
Don't move

262
12:54.639 --> 12:55.600
Ma Guowen?

263
12:59.320 --> 13:00.480
The factory director is dead.

264
13:01.679 --> 13:02.600
Where was he found?

265
13:04.120 --> 13:04.960
When?

266
13:06.519 --> 13:08.279
Did forensics and the coroner head over?

267
13:09.639 --> 13:10.600
I'll be at the office shortly.

268
13:11.639 --> 13:12.039
Forget it.

269
13:12.080 --> 13:12.960
Just wait for me downstairs.

270
13:14.240 --> 13:15.000
Hello, Officer Han.

271
13:15.120 --> 13:15.919
I'm the new officer.

272
13:15.919 --> 13:16.720
My name is Gao Xuelin.

273
13:16.840 --> 13:17.879
Here's my letter of introduction.

274
13:18.840 --> 13:19.360
Listen, rookie.

275
13:19.399 --> 13:20.200
Go report to the second floor.

276
13:20.200 --> 13:20.840
This is the third floor.

277
13:21.000 --> 13:21.480
Brother Chuang.

278
13:23.759 --> 13:25.000
A call came in from the Lapi Brewery freight yard.

279
13:25.720 --> 13:27.240
A man's body was found on the tracks.

280
13:27.720 --> 13:28.879
The victim is the factory director, Ma Guowen.

281
13:29.159 --> 13:30.080
Forensics is already on the way.

282
13:30.080 --> 13:31.519
Captain Cheng, put in a word with Brother Chuang for me.

283
13:32.080 --> 13:32.759
All right, thanks!

284
13:33.240 --> 13:33.639
Brother Chuang.

285
13:34.120 --> 13:34.879
Call from Detachment Chief Cheng.

286
13:35.000 --> 13:35.639
It's for you.

287
13:38.159 --> 13:39.720
The kid who handed you the phone is Gao Xuelin.

288
13:39.960 --> 13:40.799
Transferred from Qingzhou.

289
13:40.960 --> 13:41.559
He's sharp. I've seen him.

290
13:41.600 --> 13:42.320
Your team is short-handed, and he's right by me.

291
13:42.320 --> 13:43.279
Let him shadow you for now.

292
13:43.840 --> 13:45.000
I'm heading to Lapi Brewery right now.

293
13:45.000 --> 13:45.759
Someone died over there.

294
13:46.000 --> 13:46.720
I'm on a case.

295
13:46.960 --> 13:48.159
Just have him wait in the office.

296
13:48.879 --> 13:49.399
Right, okay, sure.

297
13:50.039 --> 13:51.159
Wait in the office for now.

298
13:51.240 --> 13:51.960
Head over there first.

299
13:52.679 --> 13:54.159
Chuang, let me come with you to the crime scene!

300
13:54.480 --> 13:55.279
I can help out!

301
13:55.600 --> 13:56.440
Logging evidence,

302
13:56.440 --> 13:57.440
holding back the crowd—I can do it all.

303
13:58.080 --> 13:59.000
You're something else, kid.

304
13:59.720 --> 14:01.399
Getting Detachment Chief Cheng to call me personally?

305
14:02.360 --> 14:03.480
What's your connection to him?

306
14:04.360 --> 14:05.000
None.

307
14:07.279 --> 14:07.720
Well, actually...

308
14:07.799 --> 14:08.559
There is a connection, bro.

309
14:09.000 --> 14:10.120
My connection is with you.

310
14:11.279 --> 14:11.919
With me?

311
14:11.919 --> 14:13.039
What connection do you have with me?

312
14:13.759 --> 14:15.559
My... my mentor was your classmate.

313
14:16.240 --> 14:17.360
I've got plenty of classmates.

314
14:17.360 --> 14:18.440
Half the detectives here are my classmates.

315
14:19.279 --> 14:20.440
Qiangzi, from your upper bunk.

316
14:20.720 --> 14:21.480
He's my mentor.

317
14:21.679 --> 14:22.639
I worked under him for three years.

318
14:26.840 --> 14:28.440
You're Xu Qiang's mentee?

319
14:28.639 --> 14:29.159
Yes, sir.

320
14:29.519 --> 14:31.519
Here's a handwritten letter he wrote to you.

321
14:31.759 --> 14:32.320
Want to take a look?

322
14:33.360 --> 14:33.840
A handwritten letter?

323
14:34.159 --> 14:35.039
Connected to me?

324
14:36.519 --> 14:37.240
What are you trying to pull?

325
14:37.679 --> 14:38.320
Just want to work under you.

326
14:45.159 --> 14:46.000
How did this happen?

327
14:46.960 --> 14:47.519
Huzi.

328
14:48.840 --> 14:49.679
I was so close.

329
14:51.360 --> 14:51.840
Look at this.

330
14:51.840 --> 14:53.039
Move aside, move aside, move!

331
14:53.720 --> 14:54.399
Clear the way, everyone!

332
14:54.799 --> 14:55.679
Step aside, make way!

333
15:02.720 --> 15:03.600
All right, everyone disperse!

334
15:03.759 --> 15:04.600
Stop crowding around!

335
15:05.159 --> 15:06.639
Aren't you Cao Jun, the pedicab driver?

336
15:06.919 --> 15:08.039
Stop gawking. Move along!

337
15:09.720 --> 15:11.039
You don't understand me, do you?

338
15:11.720 --> 15:12.960
If you don't leave by the count of three...

339
15:15.720 --> 15:16.279
Break it up!

340
15:20.279 --> 15:21.600
Shunzi, you think I didn't mean you?

341
15:21.919 --> 15:22.600
How'd he die?

342
15:22.600 --> 15:24.159
How many people did you bring to gawk today?

343
15:24.440 --> 15:26.120
We haven't settled that pool hall incident yet.

344
15:26.120 --> 15:26.840
I've got plenty of squad cars today.

345
15:26.840 --> 15:27.480
I can take you all in!

346
15:27.480 --> 15:27.960
Go, go, go.

347
15:28.080 --> 15:29.759
We're leaving, we're leaving.

348
15:30.759 --> 15:31.399
Let's go, let's go.

349
15:31.399 --> 15:32.039
Look at them.

350
15:33.919 --> 15:34.960
They sure love a spectacle.

351
15:37.399 --> 15:38.120
The caller said

352
15:38.120 --> 15:39.320
when the body was found,

353
15:39.480 --> 15:40.919
a black plastic bag was over the head.

354
15:41.519 --> 15:42.559
When they took it off,

355
15:42.559 --> 15:44.200
a beer bottle cap was embedded in the forehead.

356
15:44.519 --> 15:45.639
They were filming at the time,

357
15:46.039 --> 15:46.840
so they caught it all on tape.

358
15:47.240 --> 15:48.320
Who authorized them to film?

359
15:49.000 --> 15:50.759
They were shooting a factory promo.

360
15:52.720 --> 15:53.360
They called it in?

361
15:54.080 --> 15:54.519
Yes.

362
15:55.039 --> 15:56.759
Take them back and get their statements first.

363
15:56.759 --> 15:57.080
Okay.

364
15:58.200 --> 15:59.799
Who's in charge around here?

365
16:00.159 --> 16:00.919
Old Qian! Old Qian!

366
16:01.159 --> 16:02.519
Old Qian! Where is he?

367
16:03.399 --> 16:03.919
Name.

368
16:04.120 --> 16:04.679
Occupation?

369
16:05.159 --> 16:05.799
Qian the Cripple.

370
16:05.960 --> 16:06.639
Gatekeeper.

371
16:09.080 --> 16:10.559
Is that the name on your ID?

372
16:10.720 --> 16:11.440
Qian the Cripple?

373
16:12.120 --> 16:13.200
"Qian" as in money-grubbing.

374
16:14.200 --> 16:15.159
"Yi" as in ungrateful backstabber.

375
16:16.120 --> 16:17.080
"Chuan" as in tiger brought low on a plain.

376
16:17.080 --> 16:17.799
Qian Yichuan.

377
16:18.519 --> 16:19.399
Who died over there?

378
16:19.759 --> 16:20.480
Ma Guowen?

379
16:21.879 --> 16:22.720
How'd he die?

380
16:23.320 --> 16:24.480
Hit by a train?

381
16:25.879 --> 16:26.799
None of your business.

382
16:28.679 --> 16:29.799
Do you have surveillance cameras here?

383
16:30.000 --> 16:30.440
No.

384
16:30.519 --> 16:30.960
None.

385
16:31.200 --> 16:32.399
Been broken for ages.

386
16:32.960 --> 16:34.759
Requested repairs from Ma Guowen,

387
16:34.879 --> 16:35.519
but he said no need.

388
16:35.519 --> 16:36.679
Said I'm a human security camera,

389
16:36.679 --> 16:37.399
so those gadgets are useless.

390
16:38.039 --> 16:40.240
Cruising in a Benz yesterday, living large,

391
16:40.279 --> 16:41.559
and today he ended up frozen solid like a pear.

392
16:41.679 --> 16:43.000
You got a grudge against Ma Guowen?

393
16:45.320 --> 16:45.879
No, why?

394
16:46.559 --> 16:47.799
Then why the snide remarks?

395
16:48.639 --> 16:49.200
Well,

396
16:50.000 --> 16:51.320
he's not my father.

397
16:51.360 --> 16:52.960
No reason for me to mourn him, right?

398
16:53.679 --> 16:54.879
Stop cracking melon seeds!

399
16:55.320 --> 16:56.200
Throwing shells all over the floor.

400
16:56.399 --> 16:57.759
This is a crime scene, you know that?

401
16:58.679 --> 16:59.919
Are you all from the factory?

402
16:59.919 --> 17:00.679
Yes, all from the factory.

403
17:00.679 --> 17:01.720
Yes, right, all from the factory.

404
17:01.720 --> 17:02.240
Xiao Wu.

405
17:02.600 --> 17:04.960
Have them write down their names and numbers.

406
17:05.640 --> 17:07.000
There's been an incident at your factory.

407
17:07.880 --> 17:09.440
Nobody leaves Lacheng anytime soon.

408
17:09.640 --> 17:11.400
We might call you at any time.

409
17:11.400 --> 17:11.880
Understood?

410
17:12.079 --> 17:12.759
Understood, understood.

411
17:12.759 --> 17:13.119
Yes, loud and clear.

412
17:13.240 --> 17:14.279
All right then, disperse.

413
17:14.720 --> 17:16.079
Don't leave footprints or fingerprints here.

414
17:16.079 --> 17:17.160
You'll only bring trouble on yourselves.

415
17:17.480 --> 17:17.880
Got it.

416
17:18.279 --> 17:18.720
Let's go.

417
17:19.599 --> 17:20.359
Let's clear out then. Come on.

418
17:20.400 --> 17:21.359
Let's go, let's go, let's go.

419
17:26.039 --> 17:26.720
Are you free tonight? About this...

420
17:26.720 --> 17:27.480
Come over to my place for drinks.

421
17:28.240 --> 17:29.440
Can't do tonight, bro.

422
17:29.440 --> 17:30.400
I've got the night shift.

423
17:31.160 --> 17:31.759
What shift?

424
17:32.119 --> 17:33.160
The boss is dead.

425
17:33.160 --> 17:33.799
You're still working?

426
17:33.799 --> 17:34.440
You're unbelievable.

427
17:34.759 --> 17:35.640
Who's paying your wages?

428
17:39.720 --> 17:40.599
I have two findings.

429
17:40.640 --> 17:41.640
Wanted to run them by you.

430
17:42.119 --> 17:42.599
Go ahead.

431
17:42.799 --> 17:44.640
First, I think Qian Yichuan's a bit odd.

432
17:45.720 --> 17:46.400
How so?

433
17:47.039 --> 17:49.440
His limp probably wasn't from birth.

434
17:49.960 --> 17:51.039
It looks like an acquired injury.

435
17:51.640 --> 17:53.160
I've seen similar cases before.

436
17:53.480 --> 17:54.359
Must've severed a tendon,

437
17:54.359 --> 17:55.079
and it didn't heal right.

438
17:56.799 --> 17:58.599
Qian Yichuan's foot...

439
18:00.000 --> 18:02.720
Ma Guowen's men slashed his tendon.

440
18:04.160 --> 18:05.839
No wonder he held such a grudge against the victim.

441
18:06.920 --> 18:08.119
I remember that case.

442
18:11.440 --> 18:12.079
Xiao Wu.

443
18:12.519 --> 18:13.640
Did you get the numbers and addresses

444
18:13.640 --> 18:15.039
of those factory workers earlier?

445
18:16.279 --> 18:17.200
Give that...

446
18:17.720 --> 18:19.000
Qian Yichuan a call.

447
18:19.359 --> 18:20.440
Tell him to come down to our station.

448
18:21.319 --> 18:22.839
Find out what he was really doing last night.

449
18:23.319 --> 18:24.240
Make him a priority suspect.

450
18:26.559 --> 18:27.119
Right, got it.

451
18:28.039 --> 18:29.720
He tidied up around here last night,

452
18:29.720 --> 18:31.039
then went drinking with his coworkers.

453
18:31.240 --> 18:32.119
Someone vouched for him.

454
18:35.720 --> 18:37.039
My second finding is...

455
18:37.039 --> 18:38.400
I don't think this was

456
18:38.400 --> 18:39.519
Ma Guowen's primary crime scene.

457
18:39.920 --> 18:40.720
How do you know?

458
18:41.519 --> 18:43.079
The victim only wore a sweater.

459
18:43.519 --> 18:44.960
In the dead of night, in this freezing cold,

460
18:45.079 --> 18:46.240
he couldn't have lasted out here.

461
18:46.680 --> 18:48.720
He must've been in a warm place when alive,

462
18:48.799 --> 18:50.079
and dumped here after he died.

463
18:52.680 --> 18:53.559
What do you think, Boss?

464
19:08.319 --> 19:09.359
Do you know why,

465
19:09.920 --> 19:11.000
the very first time we met,

466
19:11.039 --> 19:12.839
I brought you along on such a big case?

467
19:15.599 --> 19:16.839
Out of respect for my mentor.

468
19:18.200 --> 19:19.519
Back when your mentor and I were in school,

469
19:20.240 --> 19:21.599
we were a golden duo.

470
19:22.079 --> 19:22.920
We complemented each other,

471
19:23.440 --> 19:25.279
and we always saw eye to eye.

472
19:26.559 --> 19:27.440
Right now,

473
19:28.279 --> 19:29.039
let's head to the factory office

474
19:29.400 --> 19:30.559
and find the warmest room.

475
19:34.039 --> 19:35.720
Is the director's office warm enough?

476
19:40.359 --> 19:41.079
Can you open this door?

477
19:41.759 --> 19:42.680
I don't have the key.

478
19:43.200 --> 19:44.680
The director has it.

479
19:48.160 --> 19:49.319
Was something hanging here before?

480
19:50.119 --> 19:50.599
Yes.

481
19:50.880 --> 19:51.559
Right here,

482
19:51.599 --> 19:52.400
there used to be a picture frame.

483
19:52.599 --> 19:53.519
It broke a couple of days ago,

484
19:53.839 --> 19:55.079
and the director got a new one.

485
19:55.200 --> 19:56.079
He just took it—

486
19:58.039 --> 19:59.319
The director left without locking the door.

487
20:04.240 --> 20:05.039
Is it this frame?

488
20:05.039 --> 20:05.680
The one hanging outside?

489
20:05.920 --> 20:07.640
Yeah. How did it break again?

490
20:09.160 --> 20:10.720
Where are the bottle caps from before?

491
20:10.759 --> 20:11.319
What bottle caps?

492
20:11.880 --> 20:13.079
The ones our director collected.

493
20:13.440 --> 20:14.720
Commemorative millennium edition.

494
20:14.960 --> 20:17.480
They were arranged in the shape of "2000."

495
20:19.960 --> 20:20.960
This room is pretty clean.

496
20:21.039 --> 20:22.319
Did you clean it today?

497
20:22.640 --> 20:23.359
No, I didn't.

498
20:24.279 --> 20:25.279
Usually, our director

499
20:25.440 --> 20:27.079
doesn't let us clean in here alone.

500
20:27.519 --> 20:28.720
It's only when he's around

501
20:28.720 --> 20:29.839
that he lets us tidy up.

502
20:30.359 --> 20:30.839
Besides,

503
20:30.839 --> 20:31.640
his desk

504
20:31.759 --> 20:32.880
and over by the safe,

505
20:33.039 --> 20:33.920
he never lets us go near them.

506
20:35.279 --> 20:36.359
So he cleans it himself?

507
20:38.599 --> 20:40.039
The factory is about to be sold,

508
20:40.200 --> 20:41.039
business is bad,

509
20:41.160 --> 20:42.400
and he's stressed out.

510
20:42.759 --> 20:44.000
Why would he bother

511
20:44.000 --> 20:45.119
cleaning the office?

512
20:47.079 --> 20:47.720
Ma'am,

513
20:48.240 --> 20:49.839
when you clean around here,

514
20:49.880 --> 20:50.640
is this all you wear?

515
20:51.400 --> 20:51.839
Yeah.

516
20:53.039 --> 20:53.519
Aren't you cold?

517
20:54.000 --> 20:54.640
Not really.

518
20:55.920 --> 20:56.720
This place,

519
20:57.160 --> 20:58.240
though it's not doing well,

520
20:58.319 --> 20:59.359
the heating's still pretty good.

521
21:00.119 --> 21:01.039
They don't skimp on coal.

522
21:02.359 --> 21:03.240
I felt warm walking in too.

523
21:05.039 --> 21:06.079
Did you see the director yesterday?

524
21:06.920 --> 21:07.680
Yes, I did.

525
21:07.920 --> 21:09.720
Do you remember what he was wearing?

526
21:13.880 --> 21:14.480
Just that...

527
21:15.000 --> 21:15.920
that black mink coat.

528
21:17.480 --> 21:18.000
This one?

529
21:19.279 --> 21:20.640
He wears this black mink all the time.

530
21:22.960 --> 21:23.880
Is this his bag?

531
21:24.000 --> 21:24.839
Yes, it is.

532
21:27.119 --> 21:27.559
All right.

533
21:28.319 --> 21:29.160
If anything else comes up,

534
21:29.319 --> 21:29.880
I'll call you.

535
21:30.200 --> 21:31.119
Sure, sure.

536
21:36.200 --> 21:37.319
Seal off this floor immediately.

537
21:37.680 --> 21:39.079
Have forensics come in to investigate.

538
21:39.319 --> 21:41.400
This is likely the primary crime scene.

539
21:42.559 --> 21:43.079
Copy that.

540
21:58.720 --> 21:59.440
Here's some water.

541
22:00.480 --> 22:02.680
I was so busy earlier, I didn't even say hi.

542
22:03.440 --> 22:04.160
Old classmate.

543
22:04.839 --> 22:05.799
When did you get back to Lacheng?

544
22:06.079 --> 22:06.799
Classmate?

545
22:10.039 --> 22:11.440
We went to Lacheng No. 1 High together.

546
22:12.079 --> 22:12.880
Teacher Yang...

547
22:13.400 --> 22:14.119
Do you remember?

548
22:14.720 --> 22:17.000
Our class had four troublemakers.

549
22:18.160 --> 22:19.880
Whenever Teacher Yang took study hall,

550
22:19.920 --> 22:20.880
she'd push open the door and shout,

551
22:20.960 --> 22:22.640
"Zhang Qiu, Zhang Lei, Sun Di, Sun Jinfu,

552
22:22.680 --> 22:23.279
get out here!"

553
22:26.119 --> 22:27.559
Good to see you, Sun Jinfu.

554
22:30.599 --> 22:32.000
I... I'm Han Chuang.

555
22:41.000 --> 22:41.880
We really were classmates.

556
22:45.480 --> 22:45.880
Anyway,

557
22:45.920 --> 22:46.640
just routine procedure.

558
22:47.839 --> 22:48.799
A few questions for you.

559
22:49.400 --> 22:49.799
Now then,

560
22:49.880 --> 22:52.200
according to Ma Guowen's driver,

561
22:52.759 --> 22:54.119
yesterday at noon,

562
22:54.319 --> 22:55.440
at 12:15,

563
22:55.480 --> 22:57.000
you got into Ma Guowen's car.

564
22:58.119 --> 22:58.680
Yes.

565
22:59.480 --> 23:01.720
He asked me to film a documentary for the factory.

566
23:06.200 --> 23:07.599
He gave me a 30,000 deposit.

567
23:08.039 --> 23:08.599
It's all here.

568
23:08.799 --> 23:09.480
I'm handing it over to you.

569
23:10.160 --> 23:10.839
Well,

570
23:10.920 --> 23:12.200
that has nothing to do with this case.

571
23:12.200 --> 23:12.920
Put it away.

572
23:14.400 --> 23:16.400
He told me this morning

573
23:16.400 --> 23:18.039
to go to the factory to sign the contract.

574
23:20.599 --> 23:21.680
Chuang, come outside for a second.

575
23:22.039 --> 23:22.960
Captain Cheng wants to see you.

576
23:24.200 --> 23:24.720
This...

577
23:24.799 --> 23:25.519
Put it away.

578
23:46.079 --> 23:48.160
You used to work at Lacheng TV Station.

579
23:50.599 --> 23:51.920
That was over a decade ago.

580
23:52.640 --> 23:54.079
You shot a film for the brewery.

581
23:54.640 --> 23:56.160
The documentary "The Malt Kingdom."

582
23:56.720 --> 23:57.400
What year was that?

583
23:58.920 --> 23:59.799
1999.

584
24:00.000 --> 24:01.640
Did you meet Ma Guowen while filming?

585
24:03.519 --> 24:04.359
I interviewed him.

586
24:05.480 --> 24:06.640
But we never had any private contact.

587
24:08.440 --> 24:09.480
That documentary of yours...

588
24:09.480 --> 24:11.440
which months did you shoot it in 1999?

589
24:13.960 --> 24:15.119
In 1999...

590
24:16.400 --> 24:19.759
from early October to early November.

591
24:23.519 --> 24:24.160
That can't be right.

592
24:25.240 --> 24:27.039
On December 31st, 1999,

593
24:27.799 --> 24:28.839
there was an auction.

594
24:29.519 --> 24:31.119
I believe you went there with your camera.

595
24:37.839 --> 24:38.799
Let me jog your memory.

596
24:40.160 --> 24:41.920
December 31st, 1999.

597
24:41.920 --> 24:42.559
New Year's Eve.

598
24:43.599 --> 24:44.799
It was bitterly cold that night.

599
24:45.759 --> 24:47.240
Someone froze to death, didn't they?

600
24:48.079 --> 24:48.519
What happened?

601
24:48.519 --> 24:49.119
What's wrong?

602
24:49.680 --> 24:50.279
What is it?

603
24:50.680 --> 24:51.480
She had too much to drink.

604
24:52.400 --> 24:53.559
What if she wandered off and got lost?

605
24:54.319 --> 24:55.039
What's going on?

606
24:56.160 --> 24:56.759
She froze to death.

607
25:06.599 --> 25:08.480
I think that happened.

608
25:09.119 --> 25:09.880
You think?

609
25:10.599 --> 25:11.519
Don't you remember?

610
25:12.240 --> 25:13.880
You even did a special report on it.

611
25:18.400 --> 25:18.920
Yes.

612
25:19.400 --> 25:20.440
That day,

613
25:20.640 --> 25:21.759
the temperature dropped sharply overnight.

614
25:22.880 --> 25:24.599
A woman froze to death on Xingfu Road.

615
25:25.519 --> 25:26.400
Early the next morning,

616
25:26.400 --> 25:28.240
the station sent me to cover the story.

617
25:28.960 --> 25:30.119
What did you film that day?

618
25:33.799 --> 25:34.680
What did I film?

619
25:34.680 --> 25:37.680
You can check the station's archives from back then.

620
25:38.599 --> 25:39.920
They should still have them.

621
25:43.119 --> 25:44.079
That...

622
25:44.359 --> 25:45.880
What was the dead woman's name?

623
25:50.880 --> 25:51.640
Liu Xuemei.

624
25:52.720 --> 25:53.400
Liu Xuemei.

625
25:54.319 --> 25:55.079
Did you know her?

626
25:56.599 --> 25:57.200
I'd interviewed her.

627
25:57.799 --> 25:58.559
Were you close with her?

628
25:59.599 --> 26:00.200
Not really.

629
26:06.319 --> 26:09.559
It seems she accidentally froze to death while drunk.

630
26:09.880 --> 26:12.119
Do you know the specifics of what happened?

631
26:13.119 --> 26:14.240
Was she really drunk?

632
26:14.799 --> 26:15.599
Who was she drinking with?

633
26:17.480 --> 26:19.160
Y-You're asking me?

634
26:19.160 --> 26:20.319
How would I know?

635
26:21.720 --> 26:22.720
Officer,

636
26:23.119 --> 26:24.960
someone freezing to death back in '99...

637
26:24.960 --> 26:27.000
what does that have to do with today's case?

638
26:28.480 --> 26:29.599
If it didn't, I wouldn't be asking.

639
26:30.240 --> 26:31.160
Please cooperate.

640
26:32.079 --> 26:33.440
I'm not a suspect.

641
26:33.440 --> 26:34.599
I've answered everything I could.

642
26:34.599 --> 26:35.759
Can I leave now?

643
26:35.759 --> 26:37.000
I'm not done with my questions.

644
26:37.480 --> 26:38.680
Please be patient and cooperate.

645
26:41.200 --> 26:42.720
I've been out since before dawn.

646
26:43.359 --> 26:46.119
Freezing, starving, terrified.

647
26:46.359 --> 26:47.599
I feel like throwing up right now.

648
26:47.680 --> 26:48.799
I want to go back, take a shower,

649
26:48.839 --> 26:49.400
and get some sleep.

650
26:49.400 --> 26:50.960
Can't you cut me some slack?

651
26:52.480 --> 26:53.319
This is a serious case.

652
26:53.480 --> 26:54.559
Please be patient and cooperate.

653
26:55.720 --> 26:57.319
How can I be patient?

654
26:58.160 --> 26:59.680
Everything you ask has nothing to do with this!

655
26:59.680 --> 27:00.960
How am I supposed to cooperate?

656
27:04.039 --> 27:04.880
What's going on?

657
27:06.839 --> 27:07.440
What's happening?

658
27:08.400 --> 27:09.440
He keeps asking me

659
27:09.440 --> 27:11.000
about the documentary back in '99,

660
27:11.359 --> 27:12.880
about that freeze-to-death case back in '99.

661
27:12.880 --> 27:13.759
What does that have to do with me?

662
27:13.759 --> 27:15.240
What does that have to do with this case?

663
27:15.920 --> 27:16.400
Don't get worked up.

664
27:16.559 --> 27:16.880
Easy now.

665
27:16.960 --> 27:17.559
Sit down, sit down.

666
27:18.960 --> 27:19.599
What's going on?

667
27:20.039 --> 27:21.960
Are you still in touch with anyone from the brewery?

668
27:26.440 --> 27:27.279
Her husband,

669
27:27.400 --> 27:28.319
Zhao Haipeng,

670
27:28.880 --> 27:30.799
was the head of publicity at Lapi Brewery.

671
27:33.240 --> 27:34.000
Ex-husband.

672
27:35.240 --> 27:36.599
Former head of publicity.

673
27:39.480 --> 27:39.920
All right.

674
27:40.000 --> 27:40.799
For today,

675
27:41.160 --> 27:41.880
let's wrap it up here.

676
27:42.720 --> 27:43.319
And then,

677
27:43.400 --> 27:44.559
you go back and get some rest.

678
27:46.599 --> 27:47.200
Just...

679
27:48.680 --> 27:49.680
don't leave Lacheng anytime soon.

680
27:52.279 --> 27:53.079
I can't leave?

681
27:55.400 --> 27:56.640
I... I have things to do tomorrow.

682
27:56.640 --> 27:57.880
I have to head back to Beijing tomorrow!

683
27:58.039 --> 27:59.440
You got into Ma Guowen's car,

684
27:59.480 --> 28:00.519
took his money,

685
28:00.960 --> 28:02.720
and showed up at the crime scene early this morning.

686
28:03.480 --> 28:04.519
You're also the one who reported it.

687
28:05.160 --> 28:06.519
The investigation has just started.

688
28:06.880 --> 28:07.920
Do you really think you can leave?

689
28:18.119 --> 28:18.640
Fine.

690
28:19.400 --> 28:20.160
Just my bad luck.

691
28:20.440 --> 28:21.640
Nothing goes right for me.

692
28:22.000 --> 28:23.079
Well, you know...

693
28:23.279 --> 28:23.880
Everyone...

694
28:24.200 --> 28:25.519
has bad days sometimes,

695
28:25.599 --> 28:26.000
right?

696
28:26.759 --> 28:27.519
Here, come on.

697
28:27.920 --> 28:29.079
Don't worry, old classmate.

698
28:29.400 --> 28:30.480
Go home, take a shower,

699
28:30.480 --> 28:31.200
and get some rest.

700
28:32.240 --> 28:32.720
Also...

701
28:33.039 --> 28:34.119
Here's my number.

702
28:34.720 --> 28:36.160
Call me if anything comes up.

703
28:39.960 --> 28:42.319
Please leave the equipment you used for filming today.

704
28:42.599 --> 28:44.279
We need it for our investigation and backup.

705
28:46.279 --> 28:48.000
I rented all that gear with my own money.

706
28:48.359 --> 28:49.160
They charge by the day.

707
28:50.480 --> 28:51.480
You don't need to leave the gear.

708
28:52.119 --> 28:53.240
Just leave the cards.

709
28:56.160 --> 28:57.079
Please write me a receipt.

710
29:06.359 --> 29:07.039
Take care.

711
29:17.160 --> 29:18.000
Come on, get in the car first.

712
29:18.599 --> 29:19.240
You all right?

713
29:20.119 --> 29:21.400
Is Lili done with her prenatal checkup?

714
29:21.400 --> 29:21.720
Yeah.

715
29:21.880 --> 29:23.079
Once that was done, I came right over.

716
29:23.839 --> 29:24.359
Get in the car first.

717
29:27.880 --> 29:28.839
What did the police say to you?

718
29:30.000 --> 29:30.920
Just grilled me with questions.

719
29:32.279 --> 29:34.079
How did Ma Guowen end up dead like that?

720
29:34.079 --> 29:35.240
Who could've done it?

721
29:35.400 --> 29:36.599
Who knows?

722
29:37.799 --> 29:39.079
He must've pissed someone off.

723
29:39.440 --> 29:40.720
You know what he was like.

724
29:45.119 --> 29:46.599
Who could hate him that much?

725
29:53.720 --> 29:54.559
Lately, you...

726
29:54.960 --> 29:55.839
shouldn't go out much.

727
29:56.480 --> 29:57.039
You hear me?

728
29:58.079 --> 29:59.559
And don't contact those old-timers.

729
30:00.599 --> 30:02.359
Why would I ever contact them?

730
30:06.359 --> 30:07.200
All right, come on.

731
30:08.400 --> 30:09.200
I'll treat you to hot pot.

732
30:09.920 --> 30:10.559
To calm your nerves.

733
30:10.599 --> 30:11.279
No, don't worry about it.

734
30:11.799 --> 30:13.119
I haven't had a chance to see my mom yet.

735
30:13.160 --> 30:13.759
I'm going to go check on her.

736
30:14.039 --> 30:14.839
Wait, wait.

737
30:15.519 --> 30:16.240
That's right on the way.

738
30:16.680 --> 30:17.279
I'll give you a ride.

739
30:28.319 --> 30:28.839
Chuang.

740
30:29.039 --> 30:31.720
The ME confirmed the bottle cap on the victim's forehead

741
30:31.839 --> 30:33.599
was embedded postmortem.

742
30:34.599 --> 30:35.039
Look here.

743
30:35.720 --> 30:37.640
Left cranial damage,

744
30:38.240 --> 30:40.160
struck with a blunt object while still alive.

745
30:40.640 --> 30:42.359
Notice the facial swelling and bruising,

746
30:42.559 --> 30:43.680
conjunctival hemorrhage,

747
30:44.160 --> 30:45.440
and lacerations around the nose and mouth

748
30:45.440 --> 30:46.880
with localized subcutaneous bleeding.

749
30:47.559 --> 30:48.839
Preliminary cause of death

750
30:49.559 --> 30:51.240
is severe craniocerebral trauma.

751
30:51.519 --> 30:52.480
Time of death?

752
30:52.960 --> 30:55.480
Between 11:00 p.m. and midnight.

753
30:56.319 --> 30:58.440
Any further findings from Ma Guowen's office?

754
30:59.200 --> 31:01.920
Forensics only found the victim's blood.

755
31:02.119 --> 31:03.920
No other biological traces were found.

756
31:04.519 --> 31:05.960
Nothing on the shattered glass frame either.

757
31:06.279 --> 31:07.839
The scene was meticulously cleaned.

758
31:08.160 --> 31:09.839
It's preliminarily confirmed as the primary scene.

759
31:11.000 --> 31:13.079
A meticulously cleaned crime scene...

760
31:13.160 --> 31:16.000
That means the killer had plenty of time.

761
31:17.319 --> 31:18.480
Ma Guowen

762
31:19.039 --> 31:19.960
didn't put up a fight,

763
31:20.960 --> 31:22.880
which suggests it was someone he knew.

764
31:27.680 --> 31:28.559
This bottle cap...

765
31:28.559 --> 31:30.720
It doesn't match the ones currently used

766
31:30.799 --> 31:31.720
by Lapi Brewery.

767
31:34.920 --> 31:36.000
Go look into this bottle cap.

768
31:36.359 --> 31:36.759
Got it.

769
31:37.880 --> 31:39.759
You didn't even tell me you were coming back.

770
31:40.880 --> 31:41.839
Showing up out of the blue...

771
31:41.880 --> 31:43.319
Are you trying to give me a heart attack?

772
31:43.920 --> 31:45.440
How have you been feeling lately?

773
31:45.480 --> 31:47.480
My heart's fine. I'm doing great.

774
31:48.599 --> 31:51.079
If Haipeng hadn't rushed me to the hospital

775
31:51.519 --> 31:52.680
for emergency bypass surgery,

776
31:52.759 --> 31:54.160
who'd be making your favorite food now?

777
31:54.559 --> 31:56.599
You've been saying that for years.

778
31:56.599 --> 31:58.240
I tried to give him money, but he wouldn't take it.

779
31:58.880 --> 32:00.400
Now that his wife has had a baby,

780
32:00.400 --> 32:01.160
we'll give him a hefty red envelope.

781
32:01.240 --> 32:01.920
Then we won't owe him anything.

782
32:02.880 --> 32:05.160
If only you had half of his good temper.

783
32:07.519 --> 32:09.480
Did they have a boy?

784
32:10.359 --> 32:11.000
What?

785
32:11.200 --> 32:12.599
You still favor boys over girls?

786
32:13.119 --> 32:14.599
Why are you biting my head off?

787
32:14.920 --> 32:15.480
Let me tell you,

788
32:15.480 --> 32:16.079
you're not getting any younger.

789
32:16.079 --> 32:16.880
You're well past the age.

790
32:17.119 --> 32:19.319
Hurry up, find a decent guy, and get married.

791
32:19.319 --> 32:20.039
Fine, fine, fine.

792
32:20.039 --> 32:21.440
Isn't that why I'm selling the apartment?

793
32:21.440 --> 32:23.000
I'm moving to Yunnan

794
32:23.000 --> 32:24.680
to open a B&amp;B with a friend.

795
32:24.680 --> 32:25.599
Once it's set up, I'll bring you over.

796
32:25.960 --> 32:26.839
What are you digging for?

797
32:27.160 --> 32:27.920
Looking for a pair of shoes.

798
32:28.640 --> 32:29.480
Put everything back when you're done!

799
32:29.759 --> 32:30.000
Okay.

800
32:30.000 --> 32:31.079
Hurry up, or just wear this pair!

801
32:31.119 --> 32:31.960
Don't worry, don't worry.

802
32:32.240 --> 32:32.920
Almost done, almost done.

803
32:32.960 --> 32:34.039
I'll tidy up, I will.

804
32:34.039 --> 32:34.640
Go back to whatever you were doing.

805
33:22.079 --> 33:23.000
A foot wash is 50.

806
33:23.000 --> 33:24.880
Aren't the seeds, peanuts, and tea free?

807
33:25.160 --> 33:26.079
Fine, fine, fine.

808
33:26.079 --> 33:26.880
Here.

809
33:28.359 --> 33:28.759
Jeez.

810
33:29.119 --> 33:30.160
Your hands are filthy.

811
33:30.279 --> 33:31.039
I'll clip your nails later.

812
33:33.559 --> 33:34.880
What do you think you're doing?

813
33:36.480 --> 33:38.000
Why are you making such a scene?

814
33:38.519 --> 33:39.880
Quite a grand entrance, huh?

815
33:40.039 --> 33:42.279
Letting the whole hallway know you're back.

816
33:42.960 --> 33:43.880
Tu Chunyan.

817
33:44.880 --> 33:46.559
What? Don't recognize me?

818
33:47.200 --> 33:48.759
You're hardly ever home,

819
33:49.000 --> 33:50.279
so I put two empty beer crates

820
33:50.319 --> 33:51.640
outside your door. So what?

821
33:51.799 --> 33:52.720
Don't you have hands?

822
33:52.720 --> 33:54.000
Couldn't you just move them yourself?

823
33:54.039 --> 33:55.079
And you reported me?

824
33:55.079 --> 33:56.079
Always running to tattle.

825
33:56.720 --> 33:58.240
Public sanitation is everyone's duty.

826
33:59.240 --> 33:59.960
What duty do you have?

827
34:00.000 --> 34:01.160
All you do is run your mouth.

828
34:01.160 --> 34:02.839
Sell your place and get the hell out.

829
34:06.640 --> 34:07.400
Disgusting.

830
34:08.159 --> 34:09.159
Why is she back?

831
34:11.119 --> 34:12.159
I'm telling you, it's pointless

832
34:12.159 --> 34:13.480
wasting your breath on her.

833
34:14.119 --> 34:14.719
If I were you,

834
34:14.719 --> 34:16.239
I'd just go up and slap her twice,

835
34:16.239 --> 34:17.039
knock her right into place.

836
34:17.679 --> 34:18.280
Shameless bitch.

837
34:18.320 --> 34:20.000
Back to shoot a movie for Ma Guowen again.

838
34:20.400 --> 34:21.320
I suspected it back then.

839
34:21.320 --> 34:23.000
She and Liu Xuemei sold us out.

840
34:23.480 --> 34:24.079
Right?

841
34:24.199 --> 34:25.360
Otherwise, how else would Ma Guowen

842
34:25.360 --> 34:26.880
know our bottom line?

843
34:27.559 --> 34:28.280
We were idiots too,

844
34:28.280 --> 34:30.679
blabbing everything right into that camera.

845
34:31.000 --> 34:32.800
Looking back, that was all evidence.

846
34:33.199 --> 34:34.760
Was she even making a movie?

847
34:35.079 --> 34:36.440
Who does she think she is?

848
34:36.559 --> 34:37.599
A total jinx.

849
34:37.880 --> 34:39.159
A walking plague.

850
34:39.159 --> 34:40.559
People die as soon as she's back.

851
34:41.119 --> 34:41.599
Disgusting.

852
34:41.599 --> 34:42.239
Great, now

853
34:42.519 --> 34:43.719
she jinxed Ma Guowen to death,

854
34:44.039 --> 34:44.920
and didn't even make any money.

855
34:46.000 --> 34:46.639
All right, I'm heading out.

856
34:47.360 --> 34:48.480
Aren't you eating with me?

857
34:48.480 --> 34:49.639
We haven't eaten together in ages.

858
34:49.679 --> 34:50.480
No time for that.

859
34:50.480 --> 34:52.159
Cripple Qian has to go back and guard the gate.

860
34:52.239 --> 34:53.079
If I'm late,

861
34:53.119 --> 34:54.639
people will think I skipped town out of guilt.

862
34:55.360 --> 34:56.320
Are you an idiot?

863
34:56.760 --> 34:57.599
Not putting on your army coat?

864
34:57.639 --> 34:58.880
Freeze yourself to death, you old cripple.

865
34:59.280 --> 34:59.599
Forgot.

866
35:00.840 --> 35:01.239
Hands out.

867
35:01.320 --> 35:01.800
Oh, boy.

868
35:04.280 --> 35:04.920
Gloves.

869
35:07.440 --> 35:08.079
Put them on.

870
35:08.119 --> 35:08.880
It's freezing out there.

871
35:09.800 --> 35:10.159
Give me a kiss.

872
35:10.239 --> 35:10.920
What are you doing?

873
35:11.400 --> 35:12.559
Come on, just one kiss.

874
35:13.480 --> 35:14.400
Not in the mood.

875
35:15.559 --> 35:16.000
Get lost.

876
36:26.159 --> 36:28.199
My name is Qian Yichuan.

877
36:28.239 --> 36:30.639
As a college graduate,

878
36:31.679 --> 36:33.719
I hope to use what I've learned

879
36:34.639 --> 36:36.559
to serve our country's brewing industry

880
36:36.840 --> 36:37.800
and make a contribution.

881
37:00.079 --> 37:01.440
Why isn't anyone worried?

882
37:02.119 --> 37:02.880
Go ask around.

883
37:03.559 --> 37:04.400
20,000 or 30,000 yuan,

884
37:04.440 --> 37:05.880
what does a severance buyout even mean?

885
37:06.039 --> 37:06.920
Will that last till you die?

886
37:08.000 --> 37:09.119
We only have two options.

887
37:09.679 --> 37:10.239
First,

888
37:10.559 --> 37:11.639
we get laid off and get the hell home.

889
37:11.960 --> 37:12.480
Second,

890
37:13.039 --> 37:14.519
we beat Ma Guowen to it

891
37:14.519 --> 37:15.360
and buy the factory ourselves.

892
37:16.519 --> 37:17.519
Just the few of us?

893
37:17.639 --> 37:18.239
We pool our money!

894
37:18.239 --> 37:19.360
Figure something out! If we aren't enough,

895
37:19.360 --> 37:20.440
what about the people around us?

896
37:20.480 --> 37:20.960
People we can trust!

897
37:20.960 --> 37:21.880
A single spark can start a prairie fire!

898
37:22.079 --> 37:22.800
What else is there to say?

899
37:22.840 --> 37:23.320
Get out!

900
37:25.159 --> 37:25.920
Let me tell you.

901
37:26.880 --> 37:27.639
Just now...

902
37:27.679 --> 37:28.480
When you were in your meeting earlier,

903
37:28.480 --> 37:29.159
she recorded the whole thing!

904
37:29.320 --> 37:29.719
What's going on?

905
37:29.800 --> 37:31.400
Wh-What did you record this for?

906
37:31.679 --> 37:32.639
Wh-Who sent you here?

907
37:33.840 --> 37:34.400
Spit it out!

908
37:36.639 --> 37:37.639
Did Ma Guowen send you?

909
37:37.800 --> 37:38.760
She secretly recorded us!

910
37:38.760 --> 37:39.280
She recorded us!

911
37:39.280 --> 37:40.039
She secretly recorded the meeting!

912
37:40.280 --> 37:41.000
Wait, this...

913
37:41.480 --> 37:42.400
I-I know about this.

914
37:42.440 --> 37:43.239
You know?

915
37:43.519 --> 37:44.400
You filmed from outside?

916
37:45.719 --> 37:46.480
In this freezing cold?

917
37:46.480 --> 37:47.400
You should film inside!

918
37:47.519 --> 37:47.960
Right, you go...

919
37:48.079 --> 37:49.280
You can't film inside either!

920
37:49.840 --> 37:51.559
If you knew, why didn't you say so?

921
37:51.559 --> 37:52.920
You have to explain this to us!

922
37:53.679 --> 37:55.199
Don't be scared, they won't do anything.

923
37:55.320 --> 37:56.199
They're just bluffing.

924
37:56.199 --> 37:56.800
L-Listen to her.

925
37:57.280 --> 37:59.079
Cold, right? Hold this to warm your hands.

926
37:59.239 --> 38:00.039
Keep it down.

927
38:00.320 --> 38:01.079
I had no choice!

928
38:01.920 --> 38:03.039
Stop talking, someone's coming.

929
38:03.159 --> 38:03.880
Someone's coming! Someone's coming!

930
38:08.519 --> 38:09.360
Have you eaten yet?

931
38:10.159 --> 38:11.480
Come on, let's head inside and crack some melon seeds.

932
38:12.360 --> 38:12.719
Right.

933
38:12.719 --> 38:13.760
Go cr-crack some seeds.

934
38:14.159 --> 38:14.599
Crack melon seeds.

935
38:14.599 --> 38:15.360
Wait, this...

936
38:15.800 --> 38:16.280
Xuemei.

937
38:16.280 --> 38:17.320
Let's go crack some melon seeds.

938
38:17.559 --> 38:18.280
Go inside.

939
38:18.280 --> 38:18.920
It's warm.

940
38:19.480 --> 38:19.880
Thank you.

941
38:19.880 --> 38:20.440
Go on, go.

942
38:21.239 --> 38:22.000
Let's go.

943
38:22.440 --> 38:23.719
You're holding her lunchbox. Take it.

944
38:33.599 --> 38:35.519
The documentary *The Malt Kingdom* that I shot

945
38:35.639 --> 38:37.599
was commissioned by the TV station.

946
38:38.239 --> 38:39.280
That one's already done.

947
38:40.320 --> 38:41.360
What I'm filming now

948
38:41.760 --> 38:42.679
wasn't ordered by the station,

949
38:43.320 --> 38:44.880
and definitely not by Director Ma.

950
38:46.320 --> 38:47.519
I was simply inspired

951
38:47.519 --> 38:49.559
by your passion to protect the plant,

952
38:50.159 --> 38:52.440
and wanted to document the whole thing.

953
38:53.239 --> 38:54.920
Maybe down the road, it could make a great film

954
38:54.920 --> 38:57.239
showing your hard work and struggle.

955
38:59.639 --> 39:01.039
Right now, I'm the one

956
39:01.480 --> 39:03.320
paying for the tapes and renting gear.

957
39:03.800 --> 39:04.880
I didn't take a dime from the factory,

958
39:05.239 --> 39:05.960
or the TV station,

959
39:06.400 --> 39:08.360
and certainly not from Ma Guowen.

960
39:09.880 --> 39:10.639
So,

961
39:10.840 --> 39:12.159
I will never sell you out.

962
39:13.000 --> 39:14.480
I'm standing with you.

963
39:19.880 --> 39:20.760
Understand?

964
39:21.559 --> 39:22.199
Believe her now?

965
39:23.480 --> 39:24.440
Puts your minds at ease, right?

966
39:25.400 --> 39:27.800
Reporter Shen is paying out of her own pocket

967
39:28.199 --> 39:29.920
to film our struggle

968
39:30.280 --> 39:32.920
against Ma Guowen and his crew,

969
39:33.000 --> 39:33.639
right?

970
39:34.519 --> 39:35.360
And when the time comes,

971
39:35.599 --> 39:36.360
once we get old,

972
39:36.960 --> 39:39.440
we can show this footage to our kids

973
39:39.440 --> 39:40.519
and grandkids!

974
39:40.960 --> 39:41.840
Let them see

975
39:41.960 --> 39:44.679
how badass their grandparents were!

976
39:44.679 --> 39:45.199
Right?

977
39:45.719 --> 39:47.400
What are you all panicking for?

978
39:47.840 --> 39:49.039
Don't be so silly!

979
39:49.840 --> 39:50.800
Haipeng, knock it off.

980
39:51.480 --> 39:52.119
I disagree—

981
39:53.480 --> 39:57.039
unless you give Chunyan and me more screen time!

982
39:57.079 --> 39:57.440
Oh, brother!

983
39:57.480 --> 39:59.519
I'll burn it onto a disc for my kids.

984
40:00.840 --> 40:01.960
I think that's pretty great.

985
40:01.960 --> 40:02.639
Come to think of it,

986
40:02.800 --> 40:04.840
if our plant ever opens a museum,

987
40:05.039 --> 40:06.679
this could be valuable history.

988
40:07.280 --> 40:07.960
It's a good thing.

989
40:08.239 --> 40:08.679
Yeah.

990
40:08.880 --> 40:09.559
Go ahead and film! Film away!

991
40:10.039 --> 40:10.519
We'll be part of—

992
40:10.519 --> 40:11.440
"Plant history"? You sure dream big.

993
40:13.000 --> 40:13.559
Haipeng.

994
40:14.559 --> 40:15.000
Sit down.

995
40:16.039 --> 40:16.639
Sit down.

996
40:19.000 --> 40:19.639
What's this?

997
40:24.079 --> 40:24.840
Around here,

998
40:25.079 --> 40:25.719
we have a rule.

999
40:26.599 --> 40:27.760
If you want to join us,

1000
40:30.039 --> 40:30.519
chug it!

1001
40:30.800 --> 40:31.360
Cut it out!

1002
40:31.360 --> 40:32.039
He's right!

1003
40:32.199 --> 40:32.800
A pledge of loyalty!

1004
40:32.800 --> 40:33.880
She doesn't know how to drink.

1005
40:34.119 --> 40:34.880
I'll drink it for her.

1006
40:39.000 --> 40:39.880
Fine.

1007
40:40.000 --> 40:41.280
All right, all right.

1008
40:41.280 --> 40:42.280
Give it to me, hand it over.

1009
40:42.320 --> 40:43.000
That's enough.

1010
40:43.159 --> 40:44.280
I'll chug the rest,

1011
40:44.519 --> 40:44.960
all right?

1012
40:44.960 --> 40:45.360
Deal.

1013
40:45.840 --> 40:46.760
Cut it out, will you?

1014
40:47.239 --> 40:48.239
Drinking on the job

1015
40:48.800 --> 40:49.559
is forbidden!

1016
40:52.559 --> 40:53.400
Why not?

1017
40:53.719 --> 40:54.519
Come on, dock his pay!

1018
40:54.760 --> 40:55.199
Never mind that.

1019
40:55.679 --> 40:56.519
Go on, keep filming.

1020
40:56.519 --> 40:56.880
Right, right.

1021
40:57.440 --> 40:58.239
Are we gonna talk business or what?

1022
40:58.719 --> 40:58.920
Come on.

1023
40:58.960 --> 40:59.639
Just now,

1024
40:59.920 --> 41:00.480
I was just...

1025
41:00.519 --> 41:01.320
Before you got here,

1026
41:01.360 --> 41:02.360
we were in the washroom...

1027
41:11.840 --> 41:13.320
Don't be nervous. Relax.

1028
41:13.800 --> 41:15.280
Yeah, don't be nervous.

1029
41:15.599 --> 41:16.440
No, I mean...

1030
41:16.559 --> 41:17.360
Go ahead, speak.

1031
41:17.840 --> 41:18.840
She's filming right now.

1032
41:18.840 --> 41:19.840
How are we supposed to scheme?

1033
41:20.239 --> 41:20.960
Exactly.

1034
41:24.199 --> 41:25.920
We're all in this together now.

1035
41:25.960 --> 41:27.320
It's not scheming if we're on the same side.

1036
41:27.719 --> 41:28.519
Right, right, right.

1037
41:28.559 --> 41:29.360
It's not scheming. Come on, come on.

1038
41:29.360 --> 41:29.719
Right.

1039
41:29.719 --> 41:30.599
Relax, relax.

1040
41:30.719 --> 41:31.039
Come on.

1041
41:31.679 --> 41:32.000
Go ahead and speak.

1042
41:32.880 --> 41:33.440
Speak up.

1043
41:34.639 --> 41:35.159
Say what?

1044
41:37.360 --> 41:38.480
Say whatever you want.

1045
41:39.159 --> 41:39.920
Just pretend I'm not here.

1046
41:40.639 --> 41:41.079
Okay.

1047
41:41.079 --> 41:41.599
Go on, speak.

1048
41:42.760 --> 41:43.920
It's about time.

1049
41:44.360 --> 41:47.000
Since Reporter Shen is here,

1050
41:47.280 --> 41:48.880
let's take a group photo of us shareholders.

1051
41:49.719 --> 41:50.800
Sure, sure. A photo!

1052
41:51.119 --> 41:51.639
A group photo.

1053
41:51.639 --> 41:52.239
Take a picture.

1054
41:52.320 --> 41:53.159
Yeah, let's take a picture.

1055
41:53.280 --> 41:54.400
Let's get a photo then.

1056
41:55.000 --> 41:55.400
Come on.

1057
41:56.639 --> 41:57.400
Come on, Xuemei.

1058
41:57.519 --> 41:58.000
Squeeze in.

1059
41:58.000 --> 41:58.400
Oh, gosh.

1060
41:59.400 --> 41:59.840
Come on.

1061
42:00.559 --> 42:01.119
Get in position.

1062
42:07.639 --> 42:08.519
Relax.

1063
42:08.920 --> 42:09.760
Right, relax.

1064
42:10.480 --> 42:11.719
Okay, listen to me.

1065
42:12.000 --> 42:12.880
Say "Lapi"!

1066
42:12.880 --> 42:13.480
Lapi!

1067
42:13.480 --> 42:14.360
Keep it down.

1068
42:16.199 --> 42:18.079
Ready, one, two, three.

1069
42:18.559 --> 42:20.480
Lapi!

1070
42:24.559 --> 42:25.880
Smile a bit, smile a bit.

1071
42:26.079 --> 42:26.639
Right, right, right.

1072
42:26.639 --> 42:27.079
You guys...

1073
42:27.199 --> 42:28.159
Honestly, you're way too tense.

1074
42:28.360 --> 42:29.320
Act natural.

1075
42:29.480 --> 42:30.039
Listen to me again.

1076
42:30.119 --> 42:31.000
Follow my lead again.

1077
42:31.320 --> 42:32.079
Get ready.

1078
42:34.280 --> 42:37.320
Lapi is our home,

1079
42:37.760 --> 42:40.800
and we all love it!

1080
42:41.079 --> 42:41.679
Yeah!

1081
43:34.079 --> 43:35.960
Who killed Ma Guowen?

1082
43:36.119 --> 43:36.920
You did.

1083
43:39.320 --> 43:40.239
I should've just...

1084
43:40.320 --> 43:41.119
killed him.

1085
43:41.880 --> 43:42.320
Right.

1086
43:42.800 --> 43:44.119
So does the killer

1087
43:44.280 --> 43:45.360
have any connection

1088
43:46.239 --> 43:47.679
to the person who filmed it?

1089
43:48.440 --> 43:49.440
Wasn't the person filming

1090
43:50.400 --> 43:51.400
Shen Leshui?

1091
43:53.880 --> 43:55.880
Lately, whenever I see black trash bags like this,

1092
43:55.880 --> 43:56.760
I get on edge.

1093
43:57.360 --> 43:58.000
What's in here?

1094
43:58.000 --> 43:58.800
Can I take a look?

1095
44:01.719 --> 44:02.280
Who is it?
